# crond root crontab — busybox crond reads /etc/crontabs/root.
# N5④ (v3 #456): wholesale /home + /var/lib/aginx (secret/ excluded, §9) +
# /etc/aginx into /var/backups/aginx/, keep 7; v3.2 (#553) keeps engine
# session transcripts (.grok/.codex sessions) out — labor exhaust is not
# the soul. Off-minute on purpose (fleet-uniform :00 piles up on the
# server when the push half exists someday). Log at
# /var/log/aginx-backup.log; rcS starts crond with -c /etc/crontabs.
# #62：crond 继承 rcS 的 TZ（device.toml）——本表从此按本地时评，
# 04:17 = 深夜 04:17 CST（此前 UTC 语义=午后 12:17 CST，非本意）。
17 4 * * * /usr/bin/aginx-backup now >> /var/log/aginx-backup.log 2>&1

# #553 log size gate (busybox has no logrotate): copytruncate tail-keep,
# over 20M → last 5M. 04:23 = right after the backup, off-minute likewise.
23 4 * * * /usr/bin/aginx-log-trim
